window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>A cursed given. A hostage taken. A world on the brink of war.</p> <p>Five of seven—that’s how many Vindix I’ve found. Usually, I’d call that a decent average, but decent is not nearly good enough and time is running out.</p> <p>Add that to the fact that Hans, one of the five Vindix I’ve managed to find, is in a coma, cursed by the vampire queen herself. Oh, and Gunner is still missing.</p> <p>Before we can solve a single one of those problems, the Princes of Hell claim their territories, throwing the human world into complete upheaval. They say when it rains it pours. Well, the Coven of Shadows and Secrets must be in a hurricane.</p> <p>But when a glimmer of light comes from a place of absolute darkness, things begin to shift, and the winds of fate turn in our favor. I only hope that they stay that way until we can finish the Princes of Hell once and for all. Bound by Destiny is the final book in the Coven of Shadows and Secrets Series. Expect six POVs, the development of three romances, and so much action and adventure it will make your head spin.</p> <p>This series is intended for listeners 18 years or older.</p>"; 
